  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "According to BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation 42 * 36 * 5 * 78 * (8 * 5) = 216\n\n**Option 1: Using the combination **÷ + × + -\n\n42 ÷ 36 + 5 × 78 + (8 – 5) = 216\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n42 ÷ 36 + 5 × 78 + 3 = 216\n\n1.17 + 5 × 78 + 3 = 216\n\n1.17 + 390 + 3 = 216\n\n394.17 = 216 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 2: Using combination + × - ÷ +**\n\n**42 + 36 × 5 - 78 ÷ (8 + 5) = 216**\n\n**42 + 36 × 5 - 78 ÷ 13 = 216**\n\n**42 + 36 × 5 - 6 = 216**\n\n**42 + 180 - 6 = 216**\n\n**222 - 6 = 216**\n\n**216 = 216 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3: Using the combination × ÷ + - +\n\n42 × 36 ÷ 5 + 78 - (8 + 5) = 216\n\n42 × 36 ÷ 5 + 78 - 13 = 216\n\n42 × 7.2 + 78 - 13 = 216\n\n302.4 + 78 - 13 = 216\n\n380.4 - 13 = 216\n\n367.4 = 216 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 4:** Using the combination - + ÷ × +\n\n42 - 36 + 5 ÷ 78 × (8 + 5) = 216\n\n42 - 36 + 5 ÷ 78 × 13 = 216\n\n42 - 36 + 0.064 × 13 = 216\n\n42 - 36 + 0.84 = 216\n\n42.84 - 36 = 216\n\n6.84 = 216 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, the answer is **“****+ × - ÷ +”.**",
